      "nonstandard_elements": "This page is a compilation of multiple Spanish cases: (1) Manolito (~80) reported an OBE with overhead viewing; (2) friend's father had an OBE+tunnel+light at ~15 and later a deceased-relative hospital vision saying 'it was not his time'; (3) secretary reported 'several spontaneous OBEs'; (4) dying cancer patient reported seeing deceased father and brother 'waiting'; (5) a child's mother saw a 'cloud of white light' cover the bed followed by recovery; (6) cousin reported suddenly being 'inside the place where all the knowledge of the universe is' and exclaimed 'God exists'.",
